        "original_id": "0952dbb7-3f67-54f2-935b-1dbd55d1bb87",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tate Donovan, Adam Pascal, Danielle Savre, Skye McCole Bartusiak\n- Films and TV series: Wild About Harry, American Primitive, Once in a Very Blue Moon, The Patriot, Don't Say a Word, 24, Boogeyman, Kill Your Darlings\n- Topics: casting, screen roles\n\nFacts:\n- Wild About Harry was originally titled American Primitive, and its script was titled Once in a Very Blue Moon.\n- Under the title American Primitive, Wild About Harry starred Tate Donovan, Adam Pascal, Danielle Savre, and Skye McCole Bartusiak.\n- Skye McCole Bartusiak appeared in The Patriot in 2000.\n- Skye McCole Bartusiak appeared in Don't Say a Word in 2001.\n- Skye McCole Bartusiak played Rose Wilder in a 2002 production.\n- Skye McCole Bartusiak appeared in 24 from 2002 to 2003.\n- Skye McCole Bartusiak appeared in Boogeyman in 2005.\n- Skye McCole Bartusiak appeared in Kill Your Darlings in 2006.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
